            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A user apparatus in a communication system comprising: a plurality of user apparatuses configured to communicate with each other in a sidelink; and a base station configured to wirelessly communicate with each of the user apparatuses, wherein the user apparatus exchanges first sidelink control information and second sidelink control information by using channels different from each other.</p>
